---
/**
 * `Doprava, parkování` and `Stravování`   the fourth section of /ubytovani.
 *
 * COPY IS THE OLD SITE'S, VERBATIM, both paragraphs.
 *
 * DESIGN / CONTENT PLACEMENT: on the old page these were two separate headed
 * paragraphs, one under the other, in a single narrow column running the length
 * of the page. They are the only two blocks on the page that answer "what
 * happens when we actually arrive", they are both short, and neither has a
 * photograph   so they are set side by side under one band instead of stacked.
 *
 * Both keep their own `<h2>`. That is deliberate and it is an SEO decision as
 * much as a reading one: `Doprava, parkování` and `Stravování` are the headings
 * the old page has been indexed under for years, and merging them under one
 * invented heading would throw that away for nothing.
 *
 * ⚠ `3 až 4 auta` here versus `4 auta` in the O nás paragraph on the homepage.
 * The old site says both, on two different pages, and this is the page that
 * says `3 až 4`. Reproduced as written; it is the client's number to settle.
 */
import IconLucide from '../../IconLucide.astro';
---

{/*
  ⚠ A <div>, not a <section>, and there is no wrapper heading.

  The first version had one   a visually hidden `Příjezd a stravování`   so the
  outer <section> would have an accessible name. It produced a broken document
  outline: three sibling <h2>s where the first is really the parent of the other
  two, which is what a screen reader's heading list and a crawler both read.

  A band is not a topic. There is nothing here to name that the two headings do
  not already name, so the outer element carries no heading and is not a
  landmark; the two real sections inside it are, each named by its own <h2>.
*/}
<div id="doprava" class="section prakticke">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prakticke-grid">
      <section class="blok" aria-labelledby="doprava-nadpis" data-reveal="up">
        <IconLucide name="car" size={30} class="blok-ikona" />
        <h2 id="doprava-nadpis">Doprava, parkování</h2>
        <p>
          K&nbsp;objektu vede příjezdová cesta dimenzovaná i&nbsp;na nákladní
          automobil. Přímo u&nbsp;objektu je parkoviště pro 3&nbsp;až 4&nbsp;auta.
          Dále je možné auta zaparkovat na příjezdové cestě, kam se vejdou další
          4&nbsp;osobní automobily.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section
        class="blok"
        aria-labelledby="stravovani-nadpis"
        data-reveal="up"
        data-reveal-delay="100"
      >
        <IconLucide name="utensils" size={30} class="blok-ikona" />
        <h2 id="stravovani-nadpis">Stravování</h2>
        <p>
          Přímo v&nbsp;obci 5&nbsp;minut chůze se nachází farma, kde se denně
          prodává čerstvé mléko a&nbsp;sýry. Ještě blíže se nachází penzion, kde se
          vaří. Doporučujeme restauraci Kačenka u&nbsp;Kláštera Hedeč
          s&nbsp;vynikající domácí kuchyní.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .prakticke {
    background-color: var(--color-omitka);
  }

  .prakticke-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  @media (width >= 48rem) {
    .prakticke-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .blok-ikona {
    color: var(--color-mosaz);
  }

  .blok h2 {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: var(--text-title-m);
    color: var(--color-mosaz-tmava);
  }

  .blok p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-kura);
  }
</style>
